# Illidan's raid-boss moves for #147: Flame Crash, Eye Blast and Flames of Azzinoth, each
# hitting b. Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# Both dash in and pass each other, b ending about 50 behind a.
40 b stick -1 0
48 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
58 a stick 0 0
# Flame Crash: jump, then down special in the air.
80 a tap B 8
92 a stick 0 -1
92 a tap X 2
93 a stick 0 0
# Eye Blast (forward smash).
260 a cstick 1 0
264 a cstick 0 0
# Flames of Azzinoth (down smash).
440 a cstick 0 -1
444 a cstick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 92 special 12 form 1
#! expect a 103 special-form 2 action 12
#! expect b 103 damage 8.000
#! expect a 260 applied attack 1 style 4
#! expect b 266 damage 17.000
#! expect a 440 applied attack 2 style 3
#! expect b 448 damage 31.000
#! scene a ImmolationTarget
#! scene a VolcanoDeath
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
